\f0\b\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 1. Project Description
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 In this project, you will install and experiment with a distributed database that supports tunable consistency. You may choose MongoDB, Apache Cassandra, ScyllaDB, or another suitable database system. The database may be deployed on several physical or virtual machines, or as multiple Docker containers on one machine.\cb1 \
\cb3 The project should investigate how different database configurations affect the client-centric consistency observed by applications. The relevant models are\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 read-your-writes consistency;\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 monotonic-reads consistency;\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 monotonic-writes consistency; and\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 writes-follow-reads consistency.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 2. Requirements
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 This is a group project. Each group should contain no more than three people. Detailed requirements are:\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Set up a replicated distributed database.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Explore the consistency configurations offered by the chosen database.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Based on your understanding of the database configurations, predict whether the client-centric consistency models listed above will hold under the configurations that you plan to test.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Design and carry out your own experiments to test your predictions.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Conduct the experiments under several scenarios, such as normal operation, the failure of one or more database nodes, and a network partition.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 3. Submission
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Submit a PDF report describing the complete project. The report should:\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 describe the chosen database, deployment architecture, software versions, and installation procedure;\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 describe the consistency configurations explored, their relevant parameters, and their expected behaviour;\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 present the design and rationale for the experiments;\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 report and explain the results;\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 discuss whether the observations agree with your expectations and identify limitations of the experiments; and\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 cite the database documentation and any other sources used (including AI usage).\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
